sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant UI as Flutter UI<br>Add Food Page
  participant ST as State and Service Layer<br>Riverpod + FoodAnalysisService
  participant OS as Object Storage<br>meal-images private bucket
  participant EF as Edge Function<br>analyze-meal
  participant AI as Gemini Multimodal Model
  participant DB as PostgreSQL<br>meal_records + ai_meal_analyses

  U->>UI: Capture or upload meal photo
  UI->>ST: Start analysis request
  ST->>OS: Upload image
  OS-->>ST: storage path + signed URL

  ST->>EF: Invoke analyze-meal<br>image_path + date + JWT
  EF->>OS: Fetch image by path
  OS-->>EF: Image bytes
  EF->>AI: Prompt + response schema
  AI-->>EF: Structured JSON<br>items + totals
  EF-->>ST: analysis_id + analysis payload
  ST-->>UI: Render result for user review

  alt User edits result
    U->>UI: Edit meal name or nutrition fields
    UI->>ST: Update local analysis state
    ST-->>UI: Show edited preview
  end

  U->>UI: Confirm Add Meal
  UI->>ST: Save confirmed meal
  ST->>DB: Insert meal_records
  DB-->>ST: meal_record_id
  ST->>DB: Save ai_meal_analyses feedback<br>analysis_id + is_correct + final_result
  DB-->>ST: Save success
  ST-->>UI: Navigate home and refresh views

  opt Analysis failure path
    EF-->>ST: Error code or message
    ST-->>UI: Show retryable error feedback
  end